\[
s_{j}-s_{i}=g_{i+1}+g_{i+2}+ \dots +g_{j}
        =2^{i}\bigl(2^{\,j-i}-1\bigr),
\]

which is a binary number consisting of a block of \(j-i\) ones
followed by \(i\) zeros.  
Consequently **all** \(\binom{17}{2}=136\) positive differences are
pairwise distinct.

