### 2.  Write a general quartic  

\[
Q(x)=ax^{4}+bx^{3}+cx^{2}+dx+e .
\]

Insert this expression into (1) and equate the coefficients of the
resulting polynomial (the identity must hold for all \(x\)).
The computation (performed with **sympy**) yields a linear system
