\[
(x^{2}+x-2)Q(x-3)=(x^{2}-11x+28)Q(x)
\]

is exactly  

\[
\boxed{Q(x)=c\,(x-4)(x-1)^{2}(x+2)}\qquad(c\in\mathbb C).
\]

