x^{2}+x-2=(x+2)(x-1),\qquad x^{2}-11x+28=(x-7)(x-4),
\]

so the functional equation becomes  

\[
(x+2)(x-1)\,Q(x-3)=(x-7)(x-4)\,Q(x). \tag{1}
\]

