b_k=
\begin{cases}
1,&k=1\text{ or }k=2,\\[2pt]
0,&\text{otherwise}.
\end{cases}
\]

Thus the “increment’’ \(\Delta_k=a_k-b_k\) is  

\[
\Delta_{-1}=+1,\;\Delta_{0}=+1,\;\Delta_{1}=-1,\;\Delta_{2}=-1,
