\]

(The inequality is strict because the series on the right‑hand side
contains the terms \(1/k^{2}\) for all \(k\), while the divisor sum
contains only those \(k\) that actually divide \(t\).)

Insert (5) into (4).  For an odd \(m\ge 5\),

\[
