\]

No other integer solutions exist (the curve has rank 0 and its only
integral points are \((1,\pm1)\) and \((7,\pm37)\); the point \((1,\pm1)\)
corresponds to the non‑prime \(p=1\)).

Thus the only prime \(p\) for which (3) holds is  

\[
p=7,\qquad t=37 .
\]

